dist/
# The OpenClaw plugin's dist/ is a committed, versioned build artifact (it's
# what OpenClaw actually loads), not a Python packaging byproduct — the
# blanket dist/ rule above must not shadow it. Without this, newly added
# files under that dist/ (e.g. dist/intent-boundary.json) are silently
# skipped by a plain `git add`, which is exactly how this plugin shipped
# without its runtime JSON dependency in the first place.
!integrations/openclaw-aivan-plugin/dist/
!integrations/openclaw-aivan-plugin/dist/**
